  m_text: "Thank you for playing the Midnight Scour demo.\n\nThis build tries to showcase a small part of the final experience. The full game will expand this core stealth and survival loop across multiple distinct rooms and environments and make better use of chase sequences currently impossible in a single room.\n\nMidnight Scour is scheduled for release in late 2026.\n\nWishlist it on Steam for the full experience and support us!"
